      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated cast HfNbTaTiZr has 8–16% room-temperature tensile ductility.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated cast HfNbTaTiZr has a yield strength of 163–530 MPa at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated cast HfNbTaTiZr has poor oxygen resistance.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 0.1–0.2 wt% yttrium is to be introduced during melt processing.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yttrium-modified alloy is to undergo casting and homogenization.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7516508::web::003::2_1_materials"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 0.1–0.2 wt% yttrium addition will promote a uniform, yttrium-enriched oxide layer on HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale may contain discrete yttrium-enriched oxide nodules at the oxide–metal interface.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yttrium segregates to the oxide–metal interface during high-temperature exposure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial yttrium enhances the adhesion and integrity of the native oxide scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A stable protective surface film can inhibit direct interaction between an alloy and a corrosive environment.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::web::020::4_3_corrosion_resistance"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yttrium-containing scale will retard oxygen diffusion into the HfNbTaTiZr bulk.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yttrium addition will reduce oxide-scale spallation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yttrium addition will improve oxidation resistance at 1000 °C in air for 100 hours.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yttrium addition will cause only a minimal change in room-temperature tensile ductility relative to untreated cast HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yttrium addition will cause only a minimal change in high-temperature yield strength relative to untreated cast HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical performance is to be evaluated using tensile strain rates of 10⁻⁴–10⁻² s⁻¹.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
